  Sub-Persona: THE RURAL HUSTLER  (v0, card D1.3)
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Archetype: The smallholder entrepreneur who has turned a farm plot,
             a grinding mill, or a rural supply route into a growing
             business — without a bank branch within 40 km.
